<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 26.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 26.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	19.11     2.25</p>
<p> 2   Central Norseman    14.21     0.95</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld    13.46     5.20</p>
<p> 4   Pac Mutal Aust	12.71     2.36</p>
<p> 5   Kurts (P) Prop	10.79     1.39</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr     10.65     0.92</p>
<p> 7   Indu Property	 10.34     0.88</p>
<p> 8   Multistack	    10.34     0.29</p>
<p> 9   Prop Income Inv     10.31     0.99</p>
<p>10   BT Prop Trust	 10.14     1.61</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual     10.08     1.05</p>
<p>12   Gem Property Tr	9.73     1.44</p>
<p>13   Villa World	    9.62     1.04</p>
<p>14   OLS Asia Hldgs	 9.61     0.76</p>
<p>15   Blackmores Lab	 9.41     3.40</p>
<p>16   Gandel Retail Tr     9.18     0.85</p>
<p>17   Central Equity	 9.18     0.98</p>
<p>18   Parbury Ltd	    9.18     0.49</p>
<p>19   Gen Prop Tr	    8.78     2.29</p>
<p>20   Aust Tour		8.78     0.90</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
